    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 3 Bay View Cottage is an end of terrace  3 bedroom, 2 bathroom, 950 sq. ft. property with sea view built in 2000 and centrally located in the charming coastal village of Kilcrohane on the Sheep's Head Peninsula in south west Cork.  Option to purchase contents. \r\n\r\nLOCATION:\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently situated only a stone's throw from a shop, post office, bar and 2 restaurants.  It is a short stroll to the sea, a children's playground with tennis court, a community playing field and a pier.  Bantry, the closest town, is a 30 minute journey by car and Cork city and airport are less than 2 hours by car.  There are 5 daily round trip buses from the village to and from Bantry and beyond.\r\n\r\nTHE ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nThe property has off-street parking for one car and a garden with sea view to the rear that can be accessed from a side entrance.  The living space is as follows:\r\n\r\nDOWNSTAIRS:\r\nceramic floor tiles throughout\r\n\r\nentrance hall \r\n\r\nkitchen/dining area (3.45m x 4.4m) with sea view.  Patio doors to a small balcony with steps down to the garden.  Fitted timber kitchen cabinets, electric oven with hob, dishwasher, fridge/freezer, dishwasher\r\n\r\nutility room (1.6m x 1.5m) with washing machine and dryer\r\n\r\nliving room (3.45m x 4m) with stove\r\n\r\nguest washroom (1m x 1.26m) - WC and hand basin\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS:\r\ntimber floors throughout except for the bathroom and en-suite which have ceramic floor tiles\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom (3.3m x 4.5m).  Sea view. \r\nEn-suite shower room (0.9m x 3.2m) - shower, wash basin and WC\r\n\r\nDouble bedroom (2.65m x 3.65m)\r\n\r\nSingle bedroom (2.9m x 2.75m)\r\n\r\nBathroom (1.85m x 2.35m) - tub with overhead shower, wash basin and WC\r\n\r\nSERVICES:\r\n\r\noil central heating\r\nmains water\r\nmains sewer\r\nelectric immersion heater\r\nelectric shower in en-suite\r\nlandline telephone connection"
      },
      {
